  "human_contributions": [
    "Existing explicit repair, integration and production mandate.",
    "Also nach meiner Definition bin ich der Principal Code Owner und Product Owner. Und wenn ich sage Freigabe erteilt und ich das auch mir gut überlegt habe, gilt das zugleich als Review. Alles andere war, ist und bleibt inakzeptabel."
  ],
  "artificial_cognitive_contributions": [
    "Implemented the explicit Principal-review alternative in the existing shared gate and publisher, preserving actual GitHub state.",
    "Updated existing consumers, entrypoints and regressions; no new workflow, executor, trigger, credential store or permission scope.",
    "Updated the existing Ruleset postimage and shared enforcement predicate so protected signing and lifecycle paths accept the trusted Principal-review check instead of demanding an extra independent account review; retained strict checks, no bypass, no forced history update, deletion protection and resolved threads."
  ],
